  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In an avatars scene if you enable & use a camera to upload a new avatar thumbnail, select a different GameObject, then disable the camera, and save the scene, Unity will crash.\n\n[Likely related canny](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/deleting-the-thumbnailcapture-inside-main-camera-will-cause-unity-to-crash)\n\nScene setup:\n\n- Add a camera to your scene to use for the camera\n\n- Disable the camera by default (Unsure if required?)\n\n- Save scene.\n\nRepro:\n\n- Enable the camera Gameobject\n\n- Upload a new thumbnail for an avatar in this scene using it\n\n- Select GameObject other than the camera (??)\n\n- Disable camera GameObject\n\n- Save scene\n\nVideo:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v-_O6c-W28E",
